ite strips away frustration so you can focus on the loot \u2018n shoot fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/c7ebb744e0038e53dd6fa3291db9fd89.poster.avif?t=1767498716\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/c7ebb744e0038e53dd6fa3291db9fd89.webm?t=1767498716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/c7ebb744e0038e53dd6fa3291db9fd89.mp4?t=1767498716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUN SOLO OR WITH YOUR SQUAD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arena Breakout: Infinite offers a variety of game modes for all operators - Tactical Ops, Solo Ops, Covert Ops and fast-paced 4v4 Deathmatch modes. Whether you prefer tactical teamwork or going in alone, you decide how you take on the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/48ea78077028520e863ae275c210bf53.poster.avif?t=1767498716\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/48ea78077028520e863ae275c210bf53.webm?t=1767498716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/48ea78077028520e863ae275c210bf53.mp4?t=1767498716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TROPHY ROOM &amp; PROGRESSION </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trophy Room is your off-field stronghold, where every upgrade and decoration tells your story. That rare sniper rifle, a stack of high-tier armor, or a collection of enemy dog tags - showcase all your hard-earned loot with pride!  Here, progression never stops and each season brings fresh challenges - complete weekly and seasonal tasks to unlock rewards that grow with your lethal reputation. The crown jewel? A free, top-tier 3X3 Titanium Case ensuring your most valuable loot stays safe no matter how tough the raid gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/e611baf03f0dbf41884d3c99bcf23ec5.poster.avif?t=1767498716\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/e611baf03f0dbf41884d3c99bcf23ec5.webm?t=1767498716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/e611baf03f0dbf41884d3c99bcf23ec5.mp4?t=1767498716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAIR PLAY AND ANTI-CHEAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Arena Breakout: Infinite, fair combat isn\u2019t just a promise - it\u2019s a guarantee with our ever-improving, anti-cheat system. This includes Killcam Replays that allow you to submit a one-tap report whenever you flag suspicious activity. Moreover, we don\u2019t just punish cheaters - we make it right for you. If you\u2019re confirmed to have lost loot, gear, or a match due to cheating, automatic in-game compensation will hit your inventory. Last year alone, our anti-cheat system placed 10-year bans to punish over 123,000 players, and reimbursed over 630,000 players with over 400 Billion Koens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/14f66efd65a8d460e1737420a8a716c0.poster.avif?t=1767498716\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com